  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ASEAN-EU Green Team Europe Initiative: Transition to a Regional Circular Economy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Overall Objective (Impact) of this action is to promote a transition to a coherent regional circular, climate-neutral, and resource-efficient economy for ASEAN Member States. The action will contribute to increased advocacy, policy support, knowledge development and sharing, and awareness raising, particularly concerning plastic value chains, waste management, and waste prevention in line with circular economy principles.</narrative>
  </description>
